{{JPExclusive}}
'''Oden''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]] and was created by a collaboration event between [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event|Battle Cats and YuruDora]]. This Unit can be unlocked by playing the collaboration dungeon in YuruDora during the event period.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 231
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Oden
|name2 = Oden CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Oden CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
To avoid sugarcoating it, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] outclasses Oden in every way. Faster and more powerful attacks. Higher defense. Cheaper cost. Faster cooldown. Oden may have higher range than Rocker, though that hardly matters. Oden's attacks are too weak, even against angels. In addition, even with this range advantage, he barely outranges any enemies of note. Even ignoring the existence of Rocker, Oden's stats are nowhere near enough to justify the 375円 to deploy this UR dump.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Midranger}}

